    - "uzunca boylu, renkli g\xF6zl\xFC ve bak\u0131ml\u0131"
    - "uzunca boylu, hafif g\xF6bekli ancak geni\u015F omuzlu"
    - "g\xF6zl\xFCkl\xFC, a\xE7\u0131k tenli ve \xE7ok yak\u0131\u015F\u0131kl\u0131"
    - "kumral, g\xF6zl\xFCkl\xFC ve \xE7ok zeki"
    - "atletik yap\u0131l\u0131, bak\u0131ml\u0131 ve kirli sakall\u0131"
    - "yak\u0131\u015F\u0131kl\u0131, g\xFCzel y\xFCzl\xFC ve konu\u015Fkan"
    - "siyah sa\xE7l\u0131, a\xE7\u0131k tenli ve mask\xFClen"
    - "sar\u0131 sa\xE7l\u0131, renkli g\xF6zl\xFC ve atletik yap\u0131l\u0131"
    - "boylu poslu, iri yap\u0131l\u0131 ve a\xE7\u0131k kumral"
    - "a\xE7\u0131k tenli, renkli g\xF6zl\xFC ve karizmatik"
    - "bu\u011Fday tenli, kahverengi g\xF6zl\xFC ve \xE7ok yak\u0131\u015F\u0131kl\u0131"
    - "uzun boylu, karizmatik ve diksiyonu \xE7ok d\xFCzg\xFCn"
    - "orta boylu, renkli g\xF6zl\xFC ve \xE7ok yak\u0131\u015F\u0131kl\u0131"
    - "siyah sa\xE7l\u0131, g\xF6zleri hafif \xE7ekik ve olduk\xE7a zeki"
    - "sa\xE7lar\u0131 \u0131\u015F\u0131kta k\u0131z\u0131la \xE7alan, keskin y\xFCz
      hatlar\u0131na sahip ve \xE7ok al\u0131ml\u0131"
    - "genellikle resmi giyinen, g\xFCzel y\xFCzl\xFC ve romantik"
    - "genellikle spor giyim tercih eden, uzun boylu ve ela g\xF6zl\xFC"
    - "i\u015Fi gere\u011Fi \xFCniforma giyen, a\xE7\u0131k kumral ve yuvarlak hatl\u0131"
    - "uzunca boylu, k\u0131sa sa\xE7l\u0131, di\u015Fleri ve elleri \xE7ok g\xFCzel"
    - "dalgal\u0131 sa\xE7lara sahip, g\xF6zl\xFCkl\xFC ve \xE7ok g\xFCzel g\xFClen"
    - "d\xFCz ve uzunca sa\xE7lara sahip, karizmatik ve g\xFCzel g\xF6zl\xFC"
    - "sa\xE7lar\u0131n\u0131 k\u0131sac\u0131k kestiren, y\xFCz\xFC \xE7ok g\xFCzel
      ve kendine g\xFCvenen"
    - "zeki oldu\u011Fu bak\u0131\u015Flar\u0131ndan dahi belli olan, uzunca boylu
      ve kumral"
    - "gereksiz konu\u015Fmay\u0131 \xE7ok sevmeyen, k\u0131sa sa\xE7l\u0131 ve etkileyici
      bak\u0131\u015Flara sahip"
    - "yuvarlak hatlara ve bak\u0131ml\u0131 sa\xE7lara sahip, 1.84 boylar\u0131nda"
    - "i\u015Fi gere\u011Fi \xE7ok seyahat eden, 1.85'den biraz uzun, k\u0131sa sa\xE7l\u0131
      ve yak\u0131\u015F\u0131kl\u0131"
    - "mesle\u011Fi gere\u011Fi insanlarla \xE7ok i\xE7li d\u0131\u015Fl\u0131 olan,
      a\xE7\u0131k kumral ve yak\u0131\u015F\u0131kl\u0131"
    - "v\xFCcudunda bir ya da birden fazla d\xF6vmesi olan, koyu kumral ve orta boylu"
    - "sa\xE7lar\u0131 uzunca say\u0131labilecek, geni\u015F al\u0131nl\u0131, iri
      ve renkli g\xF6zlere sahip"
    - "1.80-1.85 boylar\u0131nda, g\xFCzel bakan ve di\u015Fleri \xE7ok d\xFCzg\xFCn"
    - "1.85'den daha uzun, hafif gamzeleri ve kirli sakal\u0131 olan"
    - "sana yabanc\u0131 gelmeyecek bir simas\u0131 olan, \xE7ok yak\u0131\u015F\u0131kl\u0131
      ve beyefendi"
    - "spor yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131 kollar\u0131ndan belli olan, orta-uzun boylu ve
      karizmatik ses tonuna sahip"
    - "1.80 civarlar\u0131nda, keskin g\xF6z ve burun yap\u0131s\u0131na sahip, \xE7ok
      esprit\xFCel"
    - "marka giyinmeyi tercih eden, teni a\xE7\u0131k bu\u011Fday ve hayli yak\u0131\u015F\u0131kl\u0131"
    - "dijital saat takmay\u0131 tercih eden, uzunca boylu ve \xE7ok okumu\u015F"
    - "y\xFCksel tahsilli, iyi kalpli ve uzunca boylu"
    - "analog saat takmay\u0131 tercih eden, g\xFCl\xFCnce g\xF6zlerinden \u0131\u015F\u0131k
      sa\xE7an, uzun boylu"
    - "saat ve aksesuar takmay\u0131 sevmeyen, sade ama yak\u0131\u015F\u0131kl\u0131"
    - "insanlar taraf\u0131ndan fiziki anlamda \xE7ok be\u011Fenilen, uzun boylu
      ve geni\u015F omuzlu"
    - "sol koluna bileklik sa\u011F koluna ise saat takan, renkli g\xF6zl\xFC"
    - "sa\u011F koluna bileklik ve sol koluna ise saat takan, az konu\u015Fan ve
      olduk\xE7a zeki"
    - "saatinin yan\u0131na bileklik takan ve klasik giyinmeyi seven, uzunca boylu,
      kahverengi g\xF6zl\xFC"
    - "orta boylu, aksesuar takmay\u0131 seven ve \xE7ok etkileyici y\xFCz hatlar\u0131na
      sahip"
    - "boyu 1.78'lerde, k\u0131sa ve dalgal\u0131 sa\xE7lar\u0131 olan, \xE7ok ho\u015F
      g\xFClen"
    - "ciddi bir duru\u015Fa ve y\xFCksek bir auraya sahip, insanlar\u0131 etkilemeyi
      iyi bilen"
    - "harika \xE7ene hatlar\u0131na sahip, uzunca boylu ve hafif kirli sakall\u0131"
    - "k\u0131sa sa\xE7l\u0131, iyi giyinen ve top sakall\u0131"
    - "g\xFCzel bakan, g\xFCzel g\xFClen, kasl\u0131, karizmatik ve g\xF6zl\xFCkl\xFC"
    - "aksesuar takmay\u0131 seven, iyi giyinen ve kendine \xE7ok bakan"
    - "1.80'den biraz k\u0131sa, ka\u015F\u0131 g\xF6z\xFC \xE7ok d\xFCzg\xFCn ve
      her konuda bilgisi olan"
    - "esmer, g\xF6zleri ye\u015File \xE7alan ve boyu olduk\xE7a uzun"
    - "uzun sa\xE7l\u0131, esmer ve atletik say\u0131labilecek v\xFCcuda sahip"
    - "uzunca boylu, k\u0131sa sa\xE7l\u0131 ve kafa \u015Fekli olduk\xE7a d\xFCzg\xFCn"
    - "y\xFCz\xFCn\xFCn sa\u011F taraf\u0131nda hafif fa\xE7as\u0131 bulunan, g\xFCzel
