    - "\xFC\xE7gen v\xFCcutlu, g\xFCzel g\xFClen, g\xF6zl\xFCks\xFCz ve \xE7ok az
      konu\u015Fan"
    - "aktif olarak spor yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131 i\xE7in fizi\u011Fi bir hayli d\xFCzg\xFCn,
      uzunca boylu ve cana yak\u0131n"
    - "sa\xE7lar\u0131 \xE7ok \xE7ok k\u0131sa, temiz y\xFCzl\xFC ve \xF6z\xFC s\xF6z\xFC
